			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Card Skill - run any scrape-collection skill (or open a project) by voice or tap. It asks what you want; type/dictate a skill name to run it, OR leave blank to browse a grouped menu (Collection / eBay / Courtyard / Money / Projects) pulled LIVE from n8server. Your answer is sent as 'pick &lt;phrase&gt;', which the router resolves skill-first then project, so brand-new skills work the moment their file exists.</string>
