				<string>Shortcuts generated by Shortcuts Playground. May contain mistakes. Always check the shortcut's actions first. Remixed via /shortcuts-playground:remix.

This shortcut was remixed from "CC Remote SSH" via the following request:

&gt; Rename to "Card Skill" (also the Siri trigger phrase); pre-fill the SSH host, user, and port with real values; keep the capture-phrase conditional but reword the prompt to ask which card skill to run; prepend "skill " to the phrase before sending it to the launcher over SSH to n8server; and update the notification. Meant to run directly from Siri, not from an iMessage automation.</string>
